- So I'm a professional
wrestler going by the name,

00:02:06.733 --> 00:02:08.479
no just kidding.

00:02:08.479 --> 00:02:10.540
So I started out on social media,

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:11.540
I did the Snapchat thing,

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:14.044
I was one of the first Snapchat pioneers,

00:02:14.044 --> 00:02:15.100
did the very first brand
deal with Snapchat,

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:16.380
kept pushing the limits

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:18.500
going from there, built
an entire community,

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:21.190
built the ecosystem for what
was Snapchat brand deals

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:23.460
and how we worked with
brands and partnerships.

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:25.600
A lot of that was through Gary.

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:28.140
From Snapchat, I learned
I wanted to diversify,

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:29.550
get something more scalable,

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:30.660
went over to YouTube,

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:31.670
that seemed more long term

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:34.130
but it still didn't have the
scalability that I wanted to.

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.070
So I continue going,

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:37.600
now we have a full
talent management agency,

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:39.150
we're really big into Esports,

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:40.980
we've got space station gaming

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:43.120
and continuing to build other businesses

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:44.480
outside of just social media.

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:45.970
